    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a way toward Victory!</h2>Help Blocku clear levels by paving the way for him!<br>Blocku can already <strong>run and jump above obstacles on his own</strong>. He's a big boy!... but he's not the smartest as he'll run towards pitfalls without thinking about it twice.<br>... and this is when you, Player, come into the picture! You can <strong>place or remove blocks using the mouse</strong> to shape the levels' layouts! This way, you can help Blocku avoid obstacles and enemies while dashing towards the finish line!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play around with Special Powers!</h2>This concept sounds fun but it needs more spice don't you think? Well, all blocks are not created equal and some indeed have <strong>special powers</strong>.<br>How about a <strong>gravity block</strong> that pulls everything close to it when it enters its range? Or how about a <strong>speed block</strong> that accelerates time for all the things that come close to it?<br>We don't want to spoil too much but, we'll let your imagination handle the rest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make and Share Levels!</h2>You're having fun with the game? Great!... then how about <strong>making your own levels</strong>? We might have missed some interesting block combinations so, you can let your imagination run wild and try it for yourself!<br>Satisfied with the result? Alright. Then how about <strong>sharing it with your friends</strong> and <strong>playing their levels</strong>? We think that this is the best part of the game and we're looking forward to playing your levels!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a way toward Victory!</h2>Help Blocku clear levels by paving the way for him!<br>Blocku can already <strong>run and jump above obstacles on his own</strong>. He's a big boy!... but he's not the smartest as he'll run towards pitfalls without thinking about it twice.<br>... and this is when you, Player, come into the picture! You can <strong>place or remove blocks using the mouse</strong> to shape the levels' layouts! This way, you can help Blocku avoid obstacles and enemies while dashing towards the finish line!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/2755826cbdc112eb8ab070808ad6154d.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play around with Special Powers!</h2>This concept sounds fun but it needs more spice don't you think? Well, all blocks are not created equal and some indeed have <strong>special powers</strong>.<br>How about a <strong>gravity block</strong> that pulls everything close to it when it enters its range? Or how about a <strong>speed block</strong> that accelerates time for all the things that come close to it?<br>We don't want to spoil too much but, we'll let your imagination handle the rest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/79adaf109e3bc3d8837b5140905be767.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/c69137df3f9298125f4b1a4a9ffc5d98.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make and Share Levels!</h2>You're having fun with the game? Great!... then how about <strong>making your own levels</strong>? We might have missed some interesting block combinations so, you can let your imagination run wild and try it for yourself!<br>Satisfied with the result? Alright. Then how about <strong>sharing it with your friends</strong> and <strong>playing their levels</strong>? We think that this is the best part of the game and we're looking forward to playing your levels!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.poster.avif?t=1725477934\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.webm?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933400/extras/ad9f841b02965f0ed67e8fe59440692b.mp4?t=1725477934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Pave the way for Blocku-dono as you build a path toward victory! Using the mouse, you can place and remove blocks to change the level's layout and avoid obstacles/enemies! There are various blocks with different powers to spice things up, and you can create your own levels to share them!",
